## IMPORTANT FUNCTIONS

sample()           - Selects random records.
train_test_split() - Splits the dataset.
stratify           - Preserves class proportions.
value_counts()     - Counts occurrences of each class.
normalize=True     - Calculates class proportions.
random_state=42    - Makes results reproducible.

## RESULT

Successfully implemented simple random sampling and
stratified sampling and compared the class distributions
of the resulting samples.
